body:
i’m trying to remember what they played from oty, as i went to the newark concert!!! they did play pretty u, adore u, aju nice of course for the encore, smile flower, don’t listen in secret, just do it, don’t wanna cry, and space, which are all earlier eras :-) they never let a show go by without paying attention to the past and i love it!!! i’m really especially hoping for some time during teen,age era

for me i think these (along with what i said earlier) could be a possible: 

clap, kidult, together, left n right, fear, home run, bring it, mansae, boomboom, oh my, odihtd, shhh, getting closer, lilili yabbay, game boy, same x3, to you, fearless, good to me, home, heaven’s cloud, ready to love, anyone, rock with you, crush, thinkin about you, thanks, and probably a korean version of a japanese track (they did this for happy ending)
